{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:713","content":{"id":713,"title":"最长回文字符串","content":[{"children":[{"text":"题目描述","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"31297507-fd16-4a10-aef3-a9a4168665cb","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"给定一个字符串 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"s","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，找到 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"s","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 中最长的回文子串。你可以假设 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"s","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的最大长度为 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"1000","type":"formatted"},{"text":"。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ff93d97f-e2a6-451e-a503-bf5f8d60651b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"示例 1：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e9daf33d-a158-4c01-9ba4-63fcb2fa6c25","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"输入: \"babad\"\n输出: \"bab\"\n注意: \"aba\" 也是一个有效答案。","collabId":"5272b7e2-0e93-4fb0-b1f2-943199bae14f","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"74623b2b-0b3a-438c-96a2-96e6336255dc","language":"java","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"426ec335-5c5e-4096-9137-f75497ac11f9"},{"children":[{"text":"示例2：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"81fd33be-03cb-4b3b-bd99-f991449eab60","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"输入: \"cbbd\"\n输出: \"bb\"","collabId":"02e7c797-cc7a-4c0e-b767-eb4d009c2cef","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"ae1cee16-c6f9-4d4f-92e2-35a6aec9d199","language":"java","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"99562a11-96a8-4098-99c2-35fedf0d38de"},{"children":[{"text":"解题思路","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c63a6704-dd95-4193-b1ce-92590552c463","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"暴力法","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"072155fa-7b86-4f04-8dc5-473ac9ed8354","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"扫描一遍字符串，判断 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"[i, j]","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"91ff2806-3eed-43b2-9336-b85b5ffe6fe6","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"[i, j]","type":"inline-math"},{"text":" 范围内的字符串是不是回文字符串，并且在这个过程中记录最长的字符串","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"fa54ab76-b047-48c3-9fb7-f436137c880b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"43493233-cbef-4def-9049-9752eb30f830","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/46bdd0bda5577fe64007e9d54e217e0a_16753488-22a8-42e9-8ca8-0cc47b6c686e.gif","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/46bdd0bda5577fe64007e9d54e217e0a_16753488-22a8-42e9-8ca8-0cc47b6c686e.gif","uuid":"0d683b09-533b-4481-9265-68c873fd0c7e","width":720},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"class Solution {\n    public String longestPalindrome(String s) {\n\n        if (s == null || s.length() < 2) {\n            return s;\n        }\n\n        char[] str = s.toCharArray();\n        int start = 0;\n        int maxLength = 1;\n\n        for (int i = 0; i < str.length - 1; i++) {\n            for (int j = i + 1; j < str.length; j++) {\n                // 如果 [i,j] 范围的字符串长度小于目前已知的最长回文字符串的长度，则无需判断\n                if ((j - i + 1) > maxLength) {\n                    // 如果是回文字符串，更新最长回文字符串的长度，以及该回文字符串的起始位置\n                    if (isPalindrome(str, i, j)) {\n                        maxLength = j - i + 1;\n                        start = i;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        return s.substring(start, start + maxLength);\n    }\n\n    // 判断 [start, end] 范围内的字符串是否为回文字符串\n    private boolean isPalindrome(char[] str, int start, int end) {\n        while (start <= end) {\n            // 判断两端的字符串是否相同,不相同则不可能是回文字符串\n            if (str[start] != str[end]) {\n                return false;\n            }\n            start++;\n            end--;\n        }\n\n        return true;\n    }\n}","collabId":"a1f7d467-35bd-4c51-9b98-4f68e3ceb450","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"f833a390-e30c-4cd0-b8f1-6d92b858fc46","language":"java","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"4447fdf1-3525-419b-aaf5-a21fcb0e9e1a"},{"children":[{"text":"动态规划","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"47972a8f-42b8-49fc-9dd5-d5222dc9f0f1","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"我们开辟一个数组 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"dp","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"818283bf-97bc-4788-a59c-4c075a452681","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"\\text{dp}","type":"inline-math"},{"text":"，","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"dp[i][j]","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"54298cfd-9153-441e-92d8-0458173ff2e0","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"\\text{dp}[i][j]","type":"inline-math"},{"text":" 表示 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"[i, j]","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"36fb9d0a-6073-4a7f-b909-873e05c52902","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"[i, j]","type":"inline-math"},{"text":" 范围内的字符串是否为回文字符串，那我们可以知道","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"411d1d76-375d-43bf-9646-dba20e4b37b1","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d57b12e3-7618-4841-829d-26cefa7cb376","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\text{dp}[i][j] = \n\\begin{cases}\n\\text{false}, &\\text{when} \\,\\,\\text{str}[i] \\neq \\text{str}[j] \\\\\n\\text{dp}[i+1][j-1], &\\text{when} \\,\\, \\text{str}[i] = \\text{str}[j]\n\\end{cases}","type":"block-math"},{"children":[{"text":"当 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"str[i] \\neq str[j]","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7f366a81-2dc8-4632-930b-90f53cda6451","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"\\text{str}[i] \\neq \\text{str}[j]","type":"inline-math"},{"text":" 的时候，那么不可能是回文字符串，如果 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"str[i] = str[j]","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6ce23e35-7804-45fc-b0c5-4c6d4d4ad0bd","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"\\text{str}[i] = \\text{str}[j]","type":"inline-math"},{"text":" 的时候，如果 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"dp[i+1][j-1] ","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f4c074ec-d765-4db2-b6c5-a281c29c7e76","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"dp[i+1][j-1] ","type":"inline-math"},{"text":" 是回文字符串，那么 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"dp[i][j]","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"cffd755d-d69b-408b-ac35-b6742a956dd8","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"dp[i][j]","type":"inline-math"},{"text":" 就是回文字符串。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"12d5345c-fba4-41f3-96fc-e14e5ed7efc3","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"但是如果 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"i + 1 > j - 1","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1e327802-2a31-4f51-90c2-0162d6f3ed8d","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"i + 1 > j - 1","type":"inline-math"},{"text":" 的话，这时 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"dp[i + 1][j - 1]","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"293cf703-f09b-4b70-85fc-60934a431550","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"dp[i + 1][j - 1]","type":"inline-math"},{"text":" 没有意义，其实这种情况就是 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"[i,j]","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"664660f9-9949-44f3-9a65-ca012b4cfe39","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"[i,j]","type":"inline-math"},{"text":" 内只有两个字符，如果 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"str[i] = str[j]","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4d9fa585-adee-487d-a723-7d72801b8429","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"\\text{str}[i] = \\text{str}[j]","type":"inline-math"},{"text":" 的话，那么它就是一个回文字符串，所以这时可以直接得到 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"dp[i][j] = true","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e9ddc478-c27d-431c-9c3b-224c1a3f753c","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"dp[i][j] = \\text{true}","type":"inline-math"},{"text":"。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b659ecfe-b590-41b0-8ba4-e26d94135b17","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d7747788-cef4-4b6d-83d8-56cfb128e372","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/dafe089c3bc468b54108eefe7c4362cc_c4257794-8e28-4e99-adad-8b910d9f19fe.gif","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/dafe089c3bc468b54108eefe7c4362cc_c4257794-8e28-4e99-adad-8b910d9f19fe.gif","uuid":"54074dc6-a22e-4ddc-9e95-6c2c15d0e8f9","width":720},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"class Solution {\n    public String longestPalindrome(String s) {\n        if (s == null || s.length() < 2) {\n            return s;\n        }\n\n        int length = s.length();\n        boolean dp[][] = new boolean[length][length];\n        for (int i = 0; i < length; i++) {\n            for (int j = 0; j < length; j++) {\n                dp[i][j] = false;\n            }\n        }\n\n        // [i,i] 表示单个字符，肯定是回文字符串\n        for (int i = 0; i < length; i++) {\n            dp[i][i] = true;\n        }\n\n        int maxLength = 1;\n        int begin  = 0;\n        // 因为 [i, j] 要用到 [i + 1, j - 1]，所以让 i 动\n        // 如果让 j 动，那么 [i + 1, j -1] 的范围没都判断过，会导致错误的结果\n        for (int j = 1; j < length; j++) {\n            for (int i = 0; i < j; i++) {\n                // 如果字符两端不相等，不是回文字符串\n                if (s.charAt(i) != s.charAt(j)) {\n                    dp[i][j] = false;\n                } else {\n                    // 如果只有两个元素，可以直接判断为回文字符串\n                    if (i + 1 > j - 1) {\n                        dp[i][j] = true;\n                    } else {\n                        // 与 dp[i + 1][j - 1] 相同\n                        dp[i][j] = dp[i + 1][j - 1];\n                    }\n                }\n\n                // 更新最长长度以及起始位置\n                if (dp[i][j] && (j - i + 1) > maxLength) {\n                    maxLength = j - i + 1;\n                    begin = i;\n                }\n            }\n            \n        }\n\n        return s.substring(begin, begin + maxLength);\n    }\n}","collabId":"8f71f151-c850-4450-a628-1bfb5763952e","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"260a83d1-4a99-4038-af04-dc4be8c039ca","language":"java","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"eba1e0ee-44ae-4a72-b1e6-53f16c43f51e"},{"children":[{"text":"中间扩散法","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"0a560e99-1919-4b28-9b39-df0565f1fc5d","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"上面的情况都是检查某个范围内的字符串是否是回文字符串，而中心扩散法，则是以某点为中心进行向外扩散，在扩散的同时检查是否是回文字符串，过程如下","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f9d69546-4b29-4645-bf87-cb2c3b55671a","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"检查该点左右两边的字符串是否相等，如果相等则继续扩散，如果不相等则停止扩散","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4f2f6d44-a76a-454a-8d35-cdfd971c6673","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"065f7577-73c0-4d7a-b436-fceea28ed153","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"停止扩散后记录该回文字符串的长度，如果大于当前记录的最大回文字符串的长度，则进行更新，为了获得该回文字符串，还需要记录该回文字符串的起始位置","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"268ee0a7-5b20-44ca-84e5-fcd4aabb86eb","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"32f02b46-b65e-4d55-b206-cc68c54a4140","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"95561515-e085-43ad-9071-bb7860f22c61","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","type":"numbered-list"},{"children":[{"text":"需要注意的是，既可以从某个字符开始扩散，也可以从字符间的空隙进行扩散","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a4de330c-a85f-4a87-97e3-1024c602d81c","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"0180c0b0-cb2b-4a12-bc48-12939c07dd81","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_07a7c060-9b13-4ea2-9149-baadf8dfda04.webp","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_07a7c060-9b13-4ea2-9149-baadf8dfda04.webp","uuid":"44325abd-8161-4013-a18f-6ac9f4a66a33","width":531.2499788900225},{"children":[{"text":"从某个点进行扩散的代码如下：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6809b8af-4a13-4926-9d44-5b0bb11eabe4","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"private int centerSpread(String s, int left, int right) {\n    int length = 0;\n    while(left >=0 && right < s.length()) {\n        if (!(s.charAt(left) == s.charAt(right))) {\n            break;\n        }\n        length++;\n        left--;\n        right++;\n    }\n\n    return length;\n}","collabId":"ca794aa4-c840-4976-847f-904524adb86b","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"e1f75f9f-8558-4404-afb9-8cfb657f4c98","language":"java","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"37592dc5-084d-4e48-b820-89756eebd712"},{"children":[{"text":"如果从某个字符进行扩散，那么 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"left","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 和 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"right","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 都是该字符的下标，如果从某个字符空隙进行扩散，则 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"left","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 和 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"right","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 分别为该空隙左右两边字符的下标。扩散的示意图如下","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6200aaed-3104-4482-9b7d-d02de3c353ba","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3d59d8a6-7aab-4892-bf8a-170e6bf6e511","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/eb9241c443f146da9ca0d7d25802fd57_0a15995c-b142-459f-a075-781129a4738b.gif","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/eb9241c443f146da9ca0d7d25802fd57_0a15995c-b142-459f-a075-781129a4738b.gif","uuid":"723ea706-9198-4561-bac3-9bf939dfe5b8","width":720},{"children":[{"text":"完整代码如下","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"90d4b4d7-2bf6-420f-8a3e-a7b58a073459","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"class Solution {\n    public String longestPalindrome(String s) {\n        int begin = 0;\n        int maxLength = 1;\n\n        for (int i = 1; i < s.length(); i++) {\n            // 从字符空隙进行扩散\n            int length1 = centerSpread(s, i - 1, i);\n            // 从字符进行扩散\n            int length2 = centerSpread(s, i, i);\n\n            // 获得二者进行扩散的回文字符串的最大长度\n            int length = (2 * length1) >= (2 * length2 - 1) ? 2 * length1 : (2 * length2 - 1);\n            // 如果比 maxLength 大，则进行更新\n            if (length > maxLength) {\n                maxLength = length;\n                begin = i - length/2;\n            }\n        }\n\n        return s.substring(begin, begin + maxLength);\n    }\n\n    private int centerSpread(String s, int left, int right) {\n        int length = 0;\n        while(left >=0 && right < s.length()) {\n            if (!(s.charAt(left) == s.charAt(right))) {\n                break;\n            }\n            length++;\n            left--;\n            right++;\n        }\n\n        return length;\n    }\n}","collabId":"641915cd-9799-482f-aa95-e95e512b4b07","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"65575030-ea9e-4155-b52f-61ce08984ac0","language":"java","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"f2f1d3b8-e71a-4f41-bc25-1dddb739fb50"},{"children":[{"text":"Manacher算法","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"86945b18-f361-469a-ac3a-6532e543d5f2","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"Manacher 算法是对中间扩散法的改进，首先我们在字符间填充 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"#","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 以此充当字符空隙，得到一个新的字符串，然后用一个数组记录新字符串每个字符能够扩散多远","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f3f55424-bbc4-45c5-88d8-a35faaf5c21f","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"b","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1a88ce21-1f0e-46b0-b7c7-82caccdba546","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"#","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7da4abb4-23f7-4aa7-8464-00e4a7f791dd","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"a","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"0c1a09da-6b7c-4118-b03d-fd1061d8eef4","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"#","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7e14fefc-06e1-4580-a09e-f952ba570884","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"b","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"625e6a8c-cdae-4e2c-a0ca-7676d137d533","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"#","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e6fcf185-b892-48b9-9da3-a56dcc0b941c","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"a","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c3cc7330-4ab3-4eb0-8084-c4e150082738","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"#","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4b642d00-d1c0-459b-ac1b-949d9b369866","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"d","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"40f61aae-2c60-4fa2-92fc-1d64ab7028dd","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"}],"collabId":"ba3c9859-955f-484b-99bf-b5a4b3320d1e","tauContract":"e0390883f5755ceda18769fa110bf264bee6f2391ac403aab2a5f429a086d8ce","type":"table-row"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"23d7b561-fabe-46a3-9a69-fa1bdf88fa5a","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2c287f5a-980c-450f-8e3e-c80ced438739","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"98ad3043-3bb1-4fa2-9eb2-ba5841cf176c","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7162d07b-9f50-4535-b552-8f6b017ddbac","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"0b858012-d61d-4252-9af4-769fe004dc19","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"db2d8f6a-dc9f-410e-821f-53bd053d8ac4","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"9f038495-87b6-4c76-ac72-48fb2b91b18f","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d7940b26-45d4-4eee-a5b1-df7fbac82634","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1737a2aa-0248-4703-bef6-5dd836b9503b","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"}],"collabId":"502fbbd6-c243-48b1-99b9-defd2a767d9f","tauContract":"e0390883f5755ceda18769fa110bf264bee6f2391ac403aab2a5f429a086d8ce","type":"table-row"}],"collabId":"c311da2a-24a4-46f6-91c4-4d81cd375c33","tauContract":"6b49184b8918108ccf1636963138d105f679894dfe0d7b7abd75a6e6db67056b","type":"table"},{"children":[{"text":"我们复用中心扩散法的代码","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3534d852-d364-42ff-a69c-6a63617f5946","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"class Solution {\n    public String longestPalindrome(String s) {\n        int begin = 0;\n        int maxLength = 1;\n        // babad => b#a#b#a#d\n        String str = String.join( \"#\", s.split(\"\"));\n\n        for (int i = 1; i < str.length(); i++) {\n            int length = centerSpread(str, i, i);\n            length = 2 * length - 1;\n            if (length >= maxLength) {\n                // #a# b#b 二者长度相同，但是应选择后面的\n                if (length > maxLength || str.charAt(i + length/2) != '#') {\n                    maxLength = length;\n                    begin = i - length/2;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        // b#a#b => bab\n        return String.join( \"\", str.substring(begin, begin + maxLength).split(\"#\"));\n    }\n\n    private int centerSpread(String s, int left, int right) {\n        int length = 0;\n        while (left >= 0 && right < s.length()) {\n            if (!(s.charAt(left) == s.charAt(right))) {\n                break;\n            }\n            length++;\n            left--;\n            right++;\n        }\n\n        return length;\n    }\n}","collabId":"141abd21-6fe0-418d-9717-1c9ae749fe1e","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"c9ef48bc-bd08-4ecd-9a2a-37fa0f384ff8","language":"java","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"897dcf02-beb1-452a-a09e-f66075956a18"},{"children":[{"text":"这个时候我们还没有使用上面提到的数组，接下来我们需要利用数组记录一些信息，从而加快中间扩散法的速度。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6bf40a1d-8c03-4f26-bb69-08259b3a2af6","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"首先我们要知道如何加快中间扩散法的速度，这就需要利用回文字符串的特点，那就是","type":"formatted"},{"color":"hsl(270, 100%, 50%)","text":"回文字符串是左右对称","type":"formatted"},{"text":"的，当我们对回文字符串内的某个字符进行中间扩散时，我们可以先找到对称位置的字符，看看它能够扩散的多远","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e51aa3a0-0ef5-4d38-a95d-1d1acab0731d","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6098d92e-2c53-4289-aa4b-b56a7d89a50c","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_3ef40f61-978e-44c8-8d84-39683832b85a.webp","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_3ef40f61-978e-44c8-8d84-39683832b85a.webp","uuid":"46b6f827-ac19-47d8-a906-af02dcdd06f5","width":430.4166495634457},{"children":[{"text":"如果它扩散的距离小于所处回文字符串的范围，那么根据对称的特点，我们不需要对该字符进行中间扩散，它能够扩散的距离就是对称位置所能扩散的距离","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c6bfd9b6-56f2-4001-b47a-a89642cb0e5c","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5319b5e0-5ded-4276-bf4b-c782f58117f2","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_57fe1022-bb47-4ff8-9502-4d10703e741a.webp","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_57fe1022-bb47-4ff8-9502-4d10703e741a.webp","uuid":"31f91dbe-bdca-4327-b90e-31d6ed9900db","width":432.4999828139948},{"children":[{"text":"但是对称位置能够扩散的距离刚好在所处回文字符串的边界，或者大于所处的回文字符串，那么此时扩散的距离就不等于对称位置能够扩散的距离，而是需要进行扩散才能确定","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5f778da1-19b2-4d7c-ae86-3c0cec60facc","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"89199065-ec02-4eca-9a58-057d47356cd3","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_146b9efc-7e3b-44b4-a84e-1e82fb701728.webp","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_146b9efc-7e3b-44b4-a84e-1e82fb701728.webp","uuid":"1f56e976-3ebe-4d26-b585-eec6a722ecd5","width":624.9999751647323},{"children":[{"text":"但是我们不需要从该字符串开始进行扩散，因为我们可以确定在回文字符串的范围内，它是对称的，所以我们只需要从回文字符串的外部进行扩散即可","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2235524d-90ed-4381-a911-e7dd3ad2bc19","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5b3275ff-c714-4117-b83c-6d95dc82729b","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_9a6d0caf-0d51-43a3-ad52-a8c38be97b2f.webp","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_9a6d0caf-0d51-43a3-ad52-a8c38be97b2f.webp","uuid":"0399dfd8-c92b-4361-a0f6-879bb37e86f7","width":478.33331432607514},{"children":[{"text":"扩散完毕后记录能够扩散后的距离，并决定是否更新 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"begin","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"maxLength","type":"formatted"},{"text":"。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ee631bbe-d91b-4018-8875-d0da078e556d","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"现在还有一个问题，如何知道某个字符处于一个回文字符串中，我们通过记录两个变量 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"center","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 和 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"maxRight","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 来表示一个回文字符串，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"center","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 表示回文字符串的中心，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"maxRight","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 表示中心离回文字符串右边界的距离","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"43e55fa8-60fe-4e41-957c-ccea7e9ccb29","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2c6ffef9-7b73-4871-a606-6b6bbe0eb97f","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_741ec791-23ff-491e-94f3-b6ae5fa9438a.webp","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_741ec791-23ff-491e-94f3-b6ae5fa9438a.webp","uuid":"2f940ccd-05d1-4552-848c-b0686ed3d928","width":430.83331621355546},{"children":[{"text":"我们认为如果字符的下标小于 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"center + maxRight","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，那么它就在一个回文字符串中。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"89d8d592-1c96-4a15-bcba-66fcf54e2beb","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"那什么时候更新这两个变量呢? 那就是在某个字符扩散之后，他向右边能够扩散的范围大于当前的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"center + maxRight","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，那么就更新 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"center","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 和 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"maxRight","type":"formatted"},{"text":"。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c528481a-1845-41bd-8c84-f6548e1bab12","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2fb51878-d8c9-4be6-a136-893c370091e6","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_03f4e546-022f-43ff-8926-ec1b8d5b524e.webp","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_03f4e546-022f-43ff-8926-ec1b8d5b524e.webp","uuid":"de9c52be-5746-4d92-bb6e-6d517f90b373","width":720},{"children":[{"text":"代码如下：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"922feaa3-c367-47d8-8a9f-8a3f5b86592b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"class Solution {\n    public String longestPalindrome(String s) {\n\t    // 将字符串转化为 a#b#c#b 的形式\n        // String newStr = String.join( \"#\", s.split(\"\"));\n        StringBuilder stringBuilder = new StringBuilder();\n        for (int i = 0; i < s.length(); i++) {\n            if (i != s.length() - 1) {\n                stringBuilder.append(s.charAt(i) + \"#\");\n            } else {\n                stringBuilder.append(s.charAt(i));\n            }\n        }\n        String newStr = stringBuilder.toString();\n\n         // records[i] 表示扩散距离\n        int[] records = new int[newStr.length()];\n\n        records[0] = 0;\n\t\t// 回文字符串的起始位置和长度\n        int begin = 0;\n        int maxLength = 1;\n\t\t// 表示回文字符串\n        int center = 0;\n        int maxRight = 0;\n\n        for (int i = 1; i < newStr.length(); i++) {\n\t\t    // 如果 str[i] 在某个回文字符串中\n            if (i <= center + maxRight) {\n\t\t\t   // 对称位置的扩散距离\n                int mirrorLength = records[2 * center - i];\n\t\t\t   // 超过或等于 center + maxRight 表示的边界，进行中间扩散，并进行必要的更新\n                if (i + mirrorLength >= center + maxRight) {\n                    // 扩散\n                    int length = center + maxRight - i;\n                    while (i + length + 1 < newStr.length() && (i -length - 1) >= 0) {\n                        if (newStr.charAt(i + length + 1) != newStr.charAt(i - length - 1)) {\n                            break;\n                        }\n                        length++;\n                    }\n                    records[i] = length;\n                    \n                    // 更新\n                    if (2 * length + 1 >= maxLength) {\n                        if (2 * length + 1 > maxLength || newStr.charAt(center) != '#') {\n                            begin = i - length;\n                            maxLength = 2 * length + 1;\n                        }\n                    }\n\n                    if (i + length > center + maxRight) {\n                        center = i;\n                        maxRight = length;\n                    }\n\n                } else {\n\t\t\t\t   // 小于 center + maxRight 形成的边界，直接使用对称位置的值\n                    records[i] = mirrorLength;\n                }\n            } else {\n\t\t\t   // 不在回文字符串中，进行中心扩散，并进行必要的更新\n                int length = 0;\n                while (i + length + 1 < newStr.length() && (i - length - 1) >= 0) {\n                    if (newStr.charAt(i + length + 1) != newStr.charAt(i - length - 1)) {\n                        break;\n                    }\n                    length++;\n                }\n\n                if (2 * length + 1 > maxLength) {\n                    begin = i - length;\n                    maxLength = 2 * length + 1;\n                }\n\n                center = i;\n                maxRight = length;\n                records[i] = length;\n            }\n        }\n\n\t    // 将 a#b#b#a 形式的字符串转化为 abba\n        // return String.join( \"\", newStr.substring(begin, begin + maxLength).split(\"#\"));\n        String ss = newStr.substring(begin, begin + maxLength);\n        StringBuilder stringBuilder1 = new StringBuilder();\n        for (int i = 0; i < ss.length(); i++) {\n            if (ss.charAt(i) != '#') {\n                stringBuilder1.append(ss.charAt(i));\n            }\n        }\n\n        return stringBuilder1.toString();\n    }\n}","collabId":"4e405946-b646-4395-ba42-4304c4548f27","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"4f620dac-97fb-470d-8c91-65c16baf28b0","language":"java","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"b9b5fb6c-e310-4bd2-bbe8-11320bb541a2"}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"LeetCode","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:718","type":"doc","id":718}},{"label":"字符串"},{"label":"最长回文字符串","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:713","type":"doc","id":713}}],"prevPage":{"title":"简化路径","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:694","type":"doc","id":694}},"nextPage":{"title":"Pow(x, n)","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:679","type":"doc","id":679}},"createTime":1729002565245,"updateTime":1793532544675,"projectId":47},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1793532544675}}